  "function_summary": {
    "summary": "SARibbon 是一个基于 Qt Widgets 的 Ribbon 界面控件库，为桌面应用程序提供类似 Microsoft Office/WPS 的现代化 Ribbon 工具栏。它继承并扩展了 Qt 的 QMenuBar/QMainWindow 体系，提供可自定义的 Ribbon 栏、分类页、面板、按钮、Gallery、主题切换以及无边框主窗口封装。库的核心使用 C++17/Qt 实现，同时提供 PyQt5/PyQt6/PySide6 的 Python 绑定。",
    "categories": [
      {
        "name": "Ribbon 栏与选项卡布局",
        "description": "提供继承自 QMenuBar 的 SARibbonBar，以及 SARibbonCategory、SARibbonContextCategory、SARibbonTabBar 等类，实现 Ribbon 的页签、分类页、上下文页和布局样式切换。",
        "evidence": [
          "src/SARibbonBar/SARibbonBar.h:1",
          "src/SARibbonBar/SARibbonCategory.h:1",
          "src/SARibbonBar/SARibbonBar.cpp"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "Ribbon 面板与按钮控件",
        "description": "提供 SARibbonPanel、SARibbonToolButton、SARibbonButtonLayoutStrategy 等，支持大/小按钮、弹出菜单、动作菜单、Gallery 项按钮以及灵活的布局策略。",
        "evidence": [
          "src/SARibbonBar/SARibbonPanel.h:1",
          "src/SARibbonBar/SARibbonToolButton.h:1",
          "src/SARibbonBar/SARibbonButtonLayoutStrategy.h:1"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "主窗口与无边框窗体封装",
        "description": "SARibbonMainWindow、SARibbonWidget 提供开箱即用的 Ribbon 主窗口；SAFramelessHelper 与可选的 QWindowKit 集成提供无边框、自定义标题栏和窗口缩放支持。",
        "evidence": [
          "src/SARibbonBar/SARibbonMainWindow.h:1",
          "src/SARibbonBar/SARibbonWidget.h:1",
          "src/SARibbonBar/SAFramelessHelper.h:1",
          "src/SARibbonBar/SARibbonMainWindow.cpp:57"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "主题与 QSS 样式管理",
        "description": "SARibbonThemeManager、SARibbonThemePalette 和 SARibbonUtil 提供内置主题（Win7/Office2013/Office2016/Office2021/Dark 等）以及 QSS 模板替换、暗色模式检测能力。",
        "evidence": [
          "src/SARibbonBar/SARibbonThemeManager.h:1",
          "src/SARibbonBar/SARibbonThemePalette.h:1",
          "src/SARibbonBar/SARibbonUtil.cpp:347"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "应用按钮、快速访问栏与系统按钮",
        "description": "SARibbonApplicationButton、SARibbonQuickAccessBar、SARibbonSystemButtonBar 提供类似 Office 的文件菜单按钮、快速工具栏和窗口控制按钮。",
        "evidence": [
          "src/SARibbonBar/SARibbonApplicationButton.h:1",
          "src/SARibbonBar/SARibbonQuickAccessBar.h:1",
          "src/SARibbonBar/SARibbonSystemButtonBar.h:1"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "Gallery 与颜色选择控件",
        "description": "SARibbonGallery、SARibbonGalleryGroup、SARibbonGalleryItem 提供 Gallery 控件；SAColorWidgets 子模块（SARibbonColorToolButton 等）提供颜色选择器、调色板菜单。",
        "evidence": [
          "src/SARibbonBar/SARibbonGallery.h:1",
          "src/SARibbonBar/colorWidgets/SAColorToolButton.h:1"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "Ribbon 自定义与配置",
        "description": "SARibbonActionsManager、SARibbonCustomizeData、SARibbonCustomizeDialog、SARibbonCustomizeWidget 支持用户自定义 Ribbon 布局、动作管理和配置持久化。",
        "evidence": [
